## Done when

- Every question is answered or deferred to `docs/DECISION-QUEUE.md`.
- Every document whose questions were all answered is `ratified`, with `owner` and
  `last-reviewed` set.
- Every answer with a real alternative has an ADR.
- `node scripts/check.mjs` passes.
